mapping "W1932.1" source="W1932" target="1912002" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source is a Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of W19 SNOMED CT 1912002 (Unspecified fall), adding
        place/activity detail (e.g. sports facility, street/road, shop/service area,
        industrial/construction site, plus an activity qualifier). The base W19 (ICD10 concept_id
        45756257) has a verified Athena crosswalk to SNOMED CT 436583 (Fall, concept_code 1912002). Target
        436583 fully subsumes the fall event; the SE place/activity qualifier is additional context the
        standard vocabulary does not model as a separate disorder. broader: target is the legitimate
        ancestor; no clinical meaning of the source falls outside it. Confidence (high): one-level
        broader, crosswalk verified on the parent W19, source is an SE national extension.
        """
}
